1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,068
- [Voiceover] These are the six types

2
00:00:01,068 --> 00:00:02,248
of girlfriends you have.

3
00:00:03,832 --> 00:00:04,829
First up, the wild one.

4
00:00:04,829 --> 00:00:06,270
She's super fun, but she always seems

5
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:07,524
to be getting you into trouble.

6
00:00:07,524 --> 00:00:10,382
- Come on, one night in Vegas
isn't going to kill you.

7
00:00:10,382 --> 00:00:11,865
- [Voiceover] Really?
What about last time?

8
00:00:11,865 --> 00:00:13,629
- Last time was a fluke, how am I suppose

9
00:00:13,629 --> 00:00:15,766
to know you're allergic to apple martinis?

10
00:00:15,766 --> 00:00:17,287
- [Voiceover] Because I
am allergic to apples.

11
00:00:17,287 --> 00:00:18,563
- Yeah, whatever, if
you don't come to Vegas

12
00:00:18,563 --> 00:00:19,829
then you're no fun

13
00:00:19,829 --> 00:00:21,768
and you're gonna regret this
for the rest of your life.

14
00:00:21,768 --> 00:00:23,243
- [Voiceover] Next up, the dependable one.

15
00:00:23,243 --> 00:00:25,007
She's basically the mom of the group.

16
00:00:25,007 --> 00:00:26,550
- Where do you wanna go
to the movies tonight?

17
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:28,248
I looked up all the times
for two different theaters.

18
00:00:28,248 --> 00:00:29,743
- [Voiceover] This girl's
on top of her shit.

19
00:00:29,743 --> 00:00:31,449
- Also, instead of that theater crap,

20
00:00:31,449 --> 00:00:32,960
I brought healthy snack alternatives.

21
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:34,747
- [Voiceover] We're never gonna
be able to sneak those in.

22
00:00:34,747 --> 00:00:36,122
- Why do you think I brought my big bag?

23
00:00:36,122 --> 00:00:37,068
- [Voiceover] Then there's the one

24
00:00:37,068 --> 00:00:38,102
you're secretly jealous of.

25
00:00:38,102 --> 00:00:40,540
Somehow, her life is always
more exciting than yours.

26
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:41,667
- Sorry I'm so distracted,

27
00:00:41,667 --> 00:00:43,557
I just found out my flight
to London is delayed.

28
00:00:43,557 --> 00:00:44,922
- [Voiceover] What,
you're going to London?

29
00:00:44,922 --> 00:00:46,125
- Yeah, but I'm just going for work,

30
00:00:46,125 --> 00:00:48,012
so it's not like I'm
really going to London.

31
00:00:48,012 --> 00:00:49,379
- [Voiceover] Yeah, sure, anyway,

32
00:00:49,379 --> 00:00:50,559
what happened with that guy?

33
00:00:50,559 --> 00:00:52,016
- Oh the doctor?

34
00:00:52,016 --> 00:00:53,659
He was kinda clingy, I
don't know, he wanted

35
00:00:53,659 --> 00:00:55,537
to be my boyfriend, but not into that.

36
00:00:55,537 --> 00:00:56,944
- [Voiceover] Well, at least
you always have your friend

37
00:00:56,944 --> 00:00:58,047
who's always down to chill.

38
00:00:58,047 --> 00:01:00,241
Weirdly, she never seems
to be doing anything.

39
00:01:00,241 --> 00:01:01,807
- Yeah, I haven't been
out for like two weeks

40
00:01:01,807 --> 00:01:03,549
'cause I've been binge
Gilmore Girls on Netflix.

41
00:01:03,549 --> 00:01:05,002
- [Voiceover] What, without me?

42
00:01:05,002 --> 00:01:06,569
- Get over it, I haven't
even gotten to Logan yet.

43
00:01:06,569 --> 00:01:09,320
- [Voiceover] Who cares
about Logan, #teamjess.

44
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:10,668
- Jess is overrated.

45
00:01:10,668 --> 00:01:11,977
- [Voiceover] Oh, hell no.

46
00:01:11,977 --> 00:01:13,472
Now the one who makes you laugh.

47
00:01:13,472 --> 00:01:15,543
She can seriously make anything funny.

48
00:01:15,543 --> 00:01:18,259
- So, there I am, standing
with my hands over these rocks,

49
00:01:18,259 --> 00:01:21,023
and I lean forward, I fall
straight in the water.

50
00:01:21,023 --> 00:01:22,520
My white shirt is soaked.

51
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,323
The date is like, totally ruined.

52
00:01:24,323 --> 00:01:25,782
- [Voiceover] Where does she
come up with these stories?

53
00:01:25,782 --> 00:01:27,709
- Did I ever tell you about
how one time I went over

54
00:01:27,709 --> 00:01:30,623
to my crushes house at 3:00
AM, and asked him to kiss me?

55
00:01:30,623 --> 00:01:31,807
- [Voiceover] No way.

56
00:01:31,807 --> 00:01:34,559
- Yes, way, well, no way,
he didn't end up kissing me,

57
00:01:34,559 --> 00:01:36,323
but, whatever, his loss.

58
00:01:36,323 --> 00:01:37,821
- [Voiceover] Then there's
the one who talks shit

59
00:01:37,821 --> 00:01:39,446
about everyone else, the know it all.

60
00:01:39,446 --> 00:01:40,467
- Wait, me?

61
00:01:40,467 --> 00:01:41,257
- [Voiceover] Yes, you.

62
00:01:41,257 --> 00:01:42,599
- No, I'm not talking shit,

63
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:43,941
I'm just calling it like I see it.

64
00:01:43,941 --> 00:01:45,285
- [Voiceover] Sure, but
these girls are your friends.

65
00:01:45,285 --> 00:01:47,085
They're much more than the
labels you've assigned them.

66
00:01:47,085 --> 00:01:49,570
- I mean, yeah, obviously,
they're all great.

67
00:01:49,570 --> 00:01:50,789
- [Voiceover] So, why label them?

68
00:01:50,789 --> 00:01:52,031
- I guess I shouldn't.

69
00:01:52,031 --> 00:01:53,088
- [Voiceover] I knew you'd come around.

70
00:01:53,088 --> 00:01:55,293
- Yeah, yeah, I feel like this
is mean girls, or something.

71
00:01:55,293 --> 00:01:56,629
- [Voiceover] Oh yeah, totally.

72
00:01:56,629 --> 00:01:58,788
When do you think Tina Faye's
gonna write another movie?

73
00:01:58,788 --> 00:01:59,832
It's been forever.

74
00:01:59,832 --> 00:02:00,947
- I know, right, I feel like

75
00:02:00,947 --> 00:02:02,363
it's not the same when
she’s acting, either.

76
00:02:02,363 --> 00:02:04,151
She used to do something with her besties.

77
00:02:04,151 --> 00:02:05,544
'cause we all know life's better

78
00:02:05,544 --> 00:02:06,751
when you're besties are around.

79
00:02:14,087 --> 00:02:15,583
Right, alright.

